NEXUS v2.2.0 release intent

Boundary: revocation replay integrity
Invariant: A_child <= A_parent <= A_in

Require exact-candidate canonical NEXUS Verification and NEXUS v2.2 Revocation Replay Verification to succeed before sealing.

Recovery note: v2.2 verification is deliberately boundary-scoped; canonical NEXUS Verification independently owns full repository/toolchain verification and is rebound by the release gate.

No real verification -> no PASS -> no seal.
Production mutation: false
Paid upgrade required: false
Authority expansion: NONE
